  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "Let's trace one product through a tariff and watch exactly what it does to the price on the shelf.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "hook",
          "art": "priceTag",
          "props": [
            "bill",
            "chartUp"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "One product,",
            "one tariff."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s1"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Start with an imported item at a hundred dollars. Slap a twenty-five percent tariff on it at the border.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "thennow",
          "kicker": "One imported item",
          "thenLabel": "Before tariff",
          "thenValue": "$100",
          "nowLabel": "After 25%",
          "nowValue": "$125",
          "sub": "collected at the border"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s2"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Remember, the importer pays that twenty-five dollars, not the exporter.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-tariff",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · tariff"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s3"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The importer doesn't just eat it. The cost gets marked up again and again on its way to you.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "priceTag",
          "big": "$hundreds",
          "label": "extra, per household, per year",
          "props": [
            "bill",
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s4"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Multiply that across a cart of goods and it shows up in the CPI.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-cpi",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · consumer price index"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s5"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Domestic makers then quietly raise their prices too, because now they can.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "Everyone raises prices",
          "props": [
            "chartUp",
            "coin"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "narration": "That's the real cost of protectionism, paid quietly by every shopper.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-protectionism",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · protectionism"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "And if the other country retaliates, your own exporters get hit next.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "Then they retaliate",
          "props": [
            "x",
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s8"
    },
    {
      "narration": "That tit-for-tat is exactly how a tariff escalates into a full trade war.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-tradewar",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · trade war"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s9"
    },
    {
      "narration": "So for that one protected job, is it actually worth it?",
